 DECISION on client2: repair client-ca-trust
========================================================================
 PROBLEM DETECTED
   Nobody can log in to this workstation with a directory account.
   Why it matters: All directory users are locked out of this machine;
   local administrator accounts still work.

 LIKELY CAUSE  (found by the diagnostic tool: CLIENT_MISSING_CA_ROOT)
   The project's certificate authority is missing from this
   workstation's list of trusted certificates.
   Found on this host: lab step-ca root not in the system trust store

 PROPOSED ACTION
   Put the project's certificate authority back in this workstation's
   trusted list (only the copy whose fingerprint matches the pinned
   value), then restart the login service.

